// =============================================================================
// AutoApply — Native macOS SwiftUI Application & WorkspaceStore
// Repository: https://github.com/CryptoDiveX/autoapply-app
// Handoff:    https://github.com/CryptoDiveX/autoapply-handoff
//
// Architecture Overview:
// - `WorkspaceStore`: MainActor ObservableObject managing UI state across all 8
//   sections (Setup, Jobs, Resumes, Knowledge Base, Voice Interview, AI Agent,
//   Connections, Settings).
// - Instantaneous UI Responsiveness: All preference tags, employment types,
//   seniority levels, and work-authorization toggles mutate `@Published` state
//   synchronously on `@MainActor` (0ms latency) and persist asynchronously on
//   `WorkspaceStore.backgroundBridgeQueue` with `preserveLocalEdits: true`.
// - Resumes & Cover Letters Studio (`ResumesStudioView`): Supports View, Edit,
//   and Split Markdown modes with automatic PDF/DOCX regeneration, and locks
//   Edit mode (`isDocumentSubmitted`) once a job application is submitted.
// =============================================================================

